{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/64b6a3ff8fabffe61145f0548ec7106c.avif?t=1771840598\" width=624 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Young naval officer Nicholas embarks on a perilous journey to the edge of the known world in search of his missing father. His quest leads him deep into the icy tundra and toward the legendary Land Beyond \u2014 a mythical island of eternal peace and prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Nicholas ventures further north, aided by the resilience of his companions \u2014 both human and animal \u2014 he begins to uncover secrets that blur the lines between myth and reality. In this unforgiving wilderness, the past is as alive as the spirits that haunt it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/96e1853740a8ed9cd67af8d12839c629.poster.avif?t=1771840598\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/96e1853740a8ed9cd67af8d12839c629.webm?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/96e1853740a8ed9cd67af8d12839c629.mp4?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/1c8d920c0ba73569aa0bec03fffed7af.avif?t=1771840598\" width=624 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Far North's wilderness is teeming with life, but survival demands skill and determination. Each of the four regions holds its own unique fauna \u2014 from elusive animals to prized fish \u2014 waiting to challenge even the most seasoned hunter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/4ddb2a0d1614aaf2fe00776f8906e2a0.poster.avif?t=1771840598\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/4ddb2a0d1614aaf2fe00776f8906e2a0.webm?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/4ddb2a0d1614aaf2fe00776f8906e2a0.mp4?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/a2791cdc5f5fa0c64053cdb6c951862a.avif?t=1771840598\" width=624 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in the Far North depends on preparation and ingenuity. Earn money from your hunts to invest in better gear, gather materials to enhance your sled, and expand your team of loyal dogs. Meet new breeds and form lasting bonds with your canine companions, whether through trade or by completing special tasks to win their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/e72ebc45dc911810ef29d338263aa97b.poster.avif?t=1771840598\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/e72ebc45dc911810ef29d338263aa97b.webm?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/e72ebc45dc911810ef29d338263aa97b.mp4?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/48a88e56c8be913a3a54fec00c9296a3.avif?t=1771840598\" width=624 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Far North is a land of legend, and its tales intertwine with your family\u2019s mysterious past. As you complete quests and connect with the locals, you\u2019ll begin to uncover the truth about your father\u2019s disappearance, your family\u2019s noble rise, and the whispers of immortality surrounding your family heirloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/1d5c054e31b2fa3eba9251d9cb37d733.poster.avif?t=1771840598\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/1d5c054e31b2fa3eba9251d9cb37d733.webm?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/1d5c054e31b2fa3eba9251d9cb37d733.mp4?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/3ae9e3f53bb30ed524e276f69e6157d2.avif?t=1771840598\" width=624 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where the rich culture of the northern people comes alive.. Encounter spirits from ancient folklore, face the terrifying abaasy demons, and navigate a land where nature and myth exist in delicate balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/32fa62522b90dcb2029582a03448cd05.poster.avif?t=1771840598\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/32fa62522b90dcb2029582a03448cd05.webm?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/32fa62522b90dcb2029582a03448cd05.mp4?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/873c7243a20b4f5a9f5c6f807228280f.avif?t=1771840598\" width=624 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the breathtaking yet treacherous landscapes of the Far North. Test your courage against the unforgiving elements, forge bonds with the people and animals of this frozen land, and uncover the ultimate truth hidden in the enigmatic Land Beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/ac9808ddd45616100ccdc4a331af4ff9.poster.avif?t=1771840598\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/ac9808ddd45616100ccdc4a331af4ff9.webm?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407450/extras/ac9808ddd45616100ccdc4a331af4ff9.mp4?t=1771840598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i